title: lines in brief
pid: 9d0d234a-4ead-4aab-88ab-5188be7d0bce
body: |2-
  two pairs of solid yellow spaced two or more feet apart
    are a "barrier"
    never cross
  one or two solid yellow, of any number:
    never cross *unless*
      turning left from a driveway or private road,
      or making a u-turn
  two white lines: never cross
  one white: can cross, but not to merge
  broken white: can cross
